msgstr "Perubahan API yang tidak kompatibel"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.9.0 and v3.0.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat pengguna antara v2.9.0 dan v3.0.0. Cakupan: "
"modul C Python di ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:94
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Setiap perubahan ditandai dengan dampaknya:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:96
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*major* — memengaruhi sebagian besar skrip yang menggunakan fitur tersebut; "
"Anda perlu melakukan porting kode."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:98
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
